<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Runs scripts/lima_master_keepalive.sh: a supervised ssh ControlMaster to
  the Colima VM that recreates the port forwards (80, 443, 8080, 8082,
  docker.sock) within ~15 s of the master dying. RUNS ON THE STUDIO. The
  script's header and docs/rca_2026-09-16_colima_ssh_master.md say why.

  Deliberately com.derekg.* not com.openclaw.*: this is host infrastructure
  supervising a connection, not scheduled work (Dagster owns that), and
  `guard_studio_only_plists` in the studio CLI is keyed on the com.openclaw
  prefix.

  Install (on the Studio, from the repo):
    cp scripts/launchd/com.derekg.lima-master-keepalive.plist ~/Library/LaunchAgents/
    launchctl bootstrap gui/$(id -u) ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.derekg.lima-master-keepalive.plist
    launchctl kickstart -k gui/$(id -u)/com.derekg.lima-master-keepalive
  The kickstart is not optional on this box: bootstrap loaded the job as
  "not running / never exited" and RunAtLoad did nothing (2026-09-16), the
  same launchd behaviour that leaves the cloudflared tunnels and Colima
  unstarted. Installed and failover-tested 2026-09-16 11:03: master killed,
  new master + all four ports + docker.sock back in 7 s, site 200 at 9 s.
  Verify:
    launchctl list | grep lima-master        # pid, exit 0
    tail -f logs/lima-master-keepalive.log   # "master pid N", then forwards as needed
    lsof -nP -iTCP:80 -sTCP:LISTEN ; docker ps
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.derekg.lima-master-keepalive</string>

  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/bin/bash</string>
    <string>/Users/derekg/trading-framework/scripts/lima_master_keepalive.sh</string>
  </array>

  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>PATH</key>
    <string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
    <key>HOME</key>
    <string>/Users/derekg</string>
  </dict>

  <key>RunAtLoad</key>
  <true/>

  <!-- The script loops forever; KeepAlive only matters if it crashes. -->
  <key>KeepAlive</key>
  <true/>
  <key>ThrottleInterval</key>
  <integer>10</integer>

  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>/Users/derekg/trading-framework/logs/lima-master-keepalive.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>/Users/derekg/trading-framework/logs/lima-master-keepalive.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
